cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LaraIoT in your research or software project, please cite it as follows."
type: software
title: "LaraIoT"
abstract: >-
  LaraIoT is a demonstrative and extensible Laravel package for developing
  web applications intended to monitor and control IoT equipment. The package
  integrates MQTT communication, device and topic management, state
  persistence, command publishing, and two alternative mechanisms for updating
  data: Polling and WebSockets.
repository-code: "https://github.com/danielpopa26/laraiot"
url: "https://github.com/danielpopa26/laraiot"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Laravel
  - Internet of Things
  - IoT
  - MQTT
  - Polling
  - WebSockets
  - Laravel Reverb
  - research software
  - demonstration software
